+# Owner delegation of automatic review
+
+- Authorization source: the owner's direct instruction in the ongoing llm-agent project conversation.
+- Owner identity: leiwenjun (repository owner jiying2007).
+- Instruction received: 2026-10-20T06:43:29Z (2026-10-20 14:43:29 Asia/Shanghai).
+- Exact instruction: “授权自动推进，自动审核，提高推进和审核质量，不用人工干预”
+- Recorded by: ChatGPT coordinating agent. This is a truthful record of the owner's execution/review delegation, not a claim that the owner personally reviewed source or field evidence.
+
+The delegation permits automatic independent source-change review, Harness repository-source review, review of genuine effect/value evidence, and review of genuine longitudinal summaries. It permits the corresponding normal protected PR, merge, component release and exact-source promotion work already requested in this project.
+
+Delegated reviewers identify themselves as AI, preserve their actual independence from implementation, review evidence before giving separate Spec and Quality verdicts, and repair or reject unresolved blocking findings. This delegation does not create missing measurements, runtime identities, credentials, signatures, field observations or product-release qualification. Existing zero-additional-cost resource constraints, source-to-live controls, native trust, evidence integrity and protected branch checks remain applicable. No claim of human review may be substituted for an AI review.
